# Project Structure

NestJS 11 + TypeORM + PostgreSQL API for BI binder parametrization.

## Root Layout

```
binder_app_backend/
├── src/                    # Application source (edit here)
├── dist/                   # Compiled output — do not edit
├── infra/postgres_data/    # Local Postgres volume (Docker, gitignored)
├── .cursor/rules/          # Cursor agent rules
├── compose.yaml            # Dev stack: app + postgres_local
├── Dockerfile
├── .env.development        # Dev env vars
├── nest-cli.json           # sourceRoot: src
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json
└── tsconfig.build.json
```

## Entry Points

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/main.ts` | Bootstrap: Swagger (`/api`), CORS, cookie-parser, global ValidationPipe |
| `src/app.module.ts` | Root module — imports all feature modules |

